  "calibration_rationale": "Policy v2: full-conversation adaptive tool/trajectory scores remain mandatory diagnostics at 0.8; observed conditional/turn-scoping false failures make them unsuitable as sole release blockers. Task success remains blocking at 0.8; domain, state and per-turn tool checks always block. Validate on labeled calibration controls and fresh holdout. See docs/CALIBRATION.md."
